El cambio de apariencia ya pide request_redraw_all; el de las preferencias de
la app solo subía defaults_revision, y una ventana sin foco no se repintaba
hasta el siguiente evento. Lo nota CurseTerm (BK-022).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F89v1xFeQ2WCVD25PBsobh
---
 crates/barrier-kit/src/platform/runtime.rs | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/crates/barrier-kit/src/platform/runtime.rs b/crates/barrier-kit/src/platform/runtime.rs
index c37a7c0..92b1b31 100644
--- a/crates/barrier-kit/src/platform/runtime.rs
+++ b/crates/barrier-kit/src/platform/runtime.rs
@@ -254,6 +254,7 @@ fn insert_ping(event_loop: &mut EventLoop<Runtime>, shell: &mut Runtime) -> Resu
                 {
                     if events.contains(&AppearanceEvent::Defaults) {
                         *shell.defaults_revision.write() += 1;
+                        shell.request_redraw_all = true;
                         shell.ping.ping();
                     }
                     if events.iter().any(|event| event.restyles()) {
